import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 291 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Ye Fan's Predatory Thinking Deconstructed: Resource Consumption of the Holy Body Path","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 291 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Ye Fan's Predatory Thinking Deconstructed: Resource Consumption of the Holy Body Path","no":291,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Ye Fan","Predatory Thinking","Desolate Ancient Holy Body","Resource Consumption"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism","22-Joint Contracting Resource Distribution Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0291_模块2-遮天-叶凡掠夺思维拆解.md","filePath":"en/0291_模块2-遮天-叶凡掠夺思维拆解.md"}`),r={name:"en/0291_模块2-遮天-叶凡掠夺思维拆解.md"};function s(a,e,l,h,u,d){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-291-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-ye-fan-s-predatory-thinking-deconstructed-resource-consumption-of-the-holy-body-path" tabindex="-1">Entry 291 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Ye Fan&#39;s Predatory Thinking Deconstructed: Resource Consumption of the Holy Body Path <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-291-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-ye-fan-s-predatory-thinking-deconstructed-resource-consumption-of-the-holy-body-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 291 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Ye Fan&#39;s Predatory Thinking Deconstructed: Resource Consumption of the Holy Body Path&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 4) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 18, 22</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-person-s-immortalization-road-how-many-people-s-possibilities-must-it-eat" tabindex="-1">Introduction: One person&#39;s immortalization road, how many people&#39;s possibilities must it eat <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-person-s-immortalization-road-how-many-people-s-possibilities-must-it-eat" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: One person&#39;s immortalization road, how many people&#39;s possibilities must it eat&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom is the origin of all critique — not taking slaughter and predation as the evolution path, Great Dao all-tier public with no private hoarding. This entry takes &quot;predatory thinking defined by structure, not by malice&quot; as methodology, dissecting the resource-consumption logic of Ye Fan&#39;s Holy Body path. The law-first axiom reminds: structural critique cannot be waived because the protagonist is a good person. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy waste under Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking is &quot;crowding-out waste&quot;:</p><ul><li>Every Holy Body breakthrough requires far-above-ordinary resources; these resources are absorbed by Ye Fan at high price / by force, raising同期 other cultivators&#39; thresholds</li><li>Massive battles erupting over key resources consume energy that could have been used for production</li><li>Opportunities Ye Fan harvests (Dao-comprehension lands, emperor-scripture fragments) if dispersed and taught, could light up a batch of peer strong ones, but only light up one</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How predatory thinking produces regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Peers&#39; ceiling lowered</strong>: the share the Holy Body alone eats directly means fewer peer competitors</li><li><strong>Dao legacies destroyed by contention</strong>: clan-extermination wars over resources sever several complete lineages</li><li><strong>&quot;Winner takes all&quot; becomes model</strong>: later generations emulate Ye Fan&#39;s path; every genius tries to replicate the &quot;grab resources → become emperor&quot; path, internal friction intensifies</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is this entry&#39;s core. Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking has three layers:</p><ul><li><strong>Resource-exclusion layer</strong>: the Holy Body physique determines his &quot;rigid demand&quot; for Source, Life Spring, Divine Bridge resources; narrative defaults that he should prioritize getting them — this is physique privilege written into the world-view</li><li><strong>Opportunity zero-sum layer</strong>: immortal medicine, immortal materials, ancient-imperial-mountain opportunities, whatever Ye Fan gets is whatever others lose; the world-view never has the increment idea of &quot;make new medicine&quot;</li><li><strong>Dao-legacy private layer</strong>: even if kind to others, Ye Fan did not textbookize or publicly release the Dao he realized; his heirs are personally &quot;selected&quot; trusted followers, not open education &quot;toward Myriad Ranks&quot;</li></ul><p>It needs emphasizing: Ye Fan did not actively slaughter innocents; he is the kinder tier of &quot;enlightened predators&quot;; but he never challenged the underlying axiom that &quot;cultivation is grabbing resources,&quot; so the further he walks, the more he solidifies this predatory logic.</p><p>Here we must say a fair word for Ye Fan: under Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; Heavenly Dao rules, a Holy Body if not grabbing resources simply cannot survive to become emperor — the rules themselves are predatory; Ye Fan only played optimally within the rules. But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s critique precisely points here: the problem is not that Ye Fan is not kind enough, but that he never asked whether this rule itself should exist. He took &quot;cultivation is grabbing resources&quot; as heaven&#39;s law, so the stronger he gets, the more this rule is consolidated. The true righteous rogue — the kind of strong one Heng Yuan Zhou expects — should begin dismantling this rule during Dao-seeking, not after Dao-seeking continue using this rule to distribute resources. What Ye Fan lacks is not good will, but questioning the underlying law.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Ye Fan&#39;s Holy Body Path</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Physique privilege = resource priority</td><td>Myriad Races&#39; differentiated paths, no physique monopolizes resources</td></tr><tr><td>Opportunities zero-sum contended</td><td>Develop increment Origin, grow the cake rather than grab the cake</td></tr><tr><td>Emperor scriptures privately transmitted to trusted followers</td><td>300 systems fully public, textbookized and network-shared</td></tr><tr><td>Peers crowded out by resources</td><td>20% Activation Strategy, batch-cultivate backbone</td></tr><tr><td>Winner-takes-all as model</td><td>More work more reward, joint contracting, fair and non-zero-sum</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Ye Fan&#39;s main resource-acquisition event chain and its effect on同期 resource prices</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;Ye Fan&#39;s normal predatory growth&quot; vs. &quot;Ye Fan switches to increment development + public teaching&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: total number of peer successes, mid-high strong-one density in civilization</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — the predatory Holy Body path maximizes personal achievement while making peer success rate drop several times over</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Holy Body resource demand inflates with realm; the reason &quot;must eat this much&quot; grows more far-fetched late</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Immortal-medicine and divine-material quantities rise and fall with plot needs</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. The predatory path&#39;s reasonableness entirely relies on &quot;protagonist halo&quot; endorsement</li></ul><p>From another angle, Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking also has an easily-forgiven cloak: he does it to protect people close to him. This motive of grabbing for loved ones makes readers emotionally stand with him. But Heng Yuan Zhou asks: is grabbing for loved ones structurally different from grabbing for strangers? No — as long as resources are zero-sum, what is grabbed for loved ones is taken from strangers. The true solution is not &quot;grab more selectively,&quot; but to grow the cake, so Ye Fan need not reach for others&#39; bowls to protect anyone.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: crowding-out peer resources, battle internal friction, opportunities concentrated on one person</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: physique privilege, zero-sum opportunities, private Dao legacy three-layer predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s predation is &quot;not opening up,&quot; Ye Fan&#39;s predation is &quot;actively grabbing resources&quot;; Ye Fan is closer to classic predatory narrative</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: resources highly concentrated on human top Holy Body; Myriad Ranks and branches almost have no share</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: zero-sum resource view cannot support multiverse collaborative development</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking is not evil, but the old Heavenly Dao&#39;s script written for him. What Heng Yuan Zhou must do is not judge Ye Fan, but burn the script itself — cultivation should not be grabbing, evolution should not be gambling.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · Ye Fan predatory thinking deconstruction described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./289_模块2-遮天-能级浪费解析.html">Entry 289 · Energy-Level Waste</a> · <a href="./299_模块2-遮天-源天师与源术.html">Entry 299 · Source Master and Source Arts</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=t(r,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
